xbrli:xbrl.ind-as:DescriptionOfNatureAndExtentOfGov:
*Government grants relates to the 
capital subsidy and power subsidy received for investment in property, plant and 
equipment. There are no unfulfilled conditions or other contingencies attached 
to these grants. 
&nbsp;
